affiliation={Educerelator (OPC) Pvt Ltd, India},
abstract={Data storytelling is a crucial skill in technical communication, allowing engineers, researchers, and professionals to transform raw data into compelling narratives that inform, engage, and persuade. The ability to present data effectively can influence decision-making processes, enhance research dissemination, and improve overall audience engagement. This workshop provides participants with hands-on experience in structuring data-driven presentations, selecting appropriate visualizations, and tailoring messages for diverse audiences. Attendees will explore storytelling frameworks, visualization best practices, and strategies for simplifying complex technical information without losing accuracy. Through interactive activities, participants will gain practical skills to enhance their technical storytelling abilities. © 2025 IEEE.},
